<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from two leading exchange dealers:</p>
<p>		     Kalia &amp; Khanani Int'l  Dubai Exchange Int'l</p>
<p> U.S. dollar     41.85/41.90		41.80/41.85</p>
<p> Pound sterling  68.20/68.30		68.20/68.30</p>
<p> Deutsche mark   25.55/25.60		25.57/25.62</p>
<p> Japanese yen    0.352/0.354		0.348/0.358</p>
<p> Saudi riyal     11.14/11.16		11.12/11.17</p>
<p> UAE dirham	11.39/11.41		11.32/11.42</p>
<p> Indian rupee     1.10/1.12		  1.07/1.12</p>
<p> F.E.B.C.	   4.55/4.70 pct	    4.30/4.70 pct</p>
